Thanks for putting this together. One piece of feedback from my side — for the **Aqua/CHRIS sections**, I feel the updates are currently quite story/task-oriented, which makes them harder to use for management reporting.

Could we make the sprint updates more **outcome and impact focused** — highlighting what was delivered, the security/production value, key milestones, and any significant progress or risks, rather than individual stories and SPs?

